Transaction-date filtering includes both postings on the transaction date.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ dateBasis: 'transaction', to: '2024-01-02' })

========== FILE ==========

2024-01-01 Delayed posting
  Assets:Cash  10 SEK ; [2024-01-03]
  Equity:Opening  -10 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "10"
  },
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "-10"
  }
]
